+| Mention | `DISCORD_MENTION_ID` → `config('services.discord.mention_id')`; when set to a valid Discord user ID (snowflake, 17-20 digits, integers accepted), every alert ends with `<@USER_ID>` on its own line (push notification). Invalid values (`@everyone`, `@here`, wrong length, extra characters) are ignored silently. Room for the mention is reserved before the 1800-character truncation. |
